OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FWinds
OL,6,Feasing considerably by Thursday,
OL,7,Fthough staying fairly breezy. A cooler
OL,8,Fand somewhat more mixed picture than
OL,9,Fof late but staying largely dry with
OL,10,Fcloudy periods and warm sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
